      "preview": "יְהוֹזָבָד: nome próprio masculino: Jeozabade.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹזָבָד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹזָבָד</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino.</strong> 𝔊 geralmente Ἰωζαβαδ <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>concedeu;</em> cf. palmireno <span dir=\"rtl\">נבוזבד</span> Vog <sup>73</sup>; v. também <a data-ref=\"BDB, זְבַדְיָהוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_זְבַדְיָהוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">זְבַדְיָהוּ</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, זַבְדִּיאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_זַבְדִּיאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">זַבְדִּיאֵל</a><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹזָבָד</span> servo e assassino de Joás de Judá <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.22\">2 K 12:22</a> (𝔊 Ἰεζεβουθ) = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:26\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.26\">2 Ch 24:26</a> (𝔊 Ζωζαβεδ, Ἰωζαβεδ, Ἰωζαβεθ).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹזָבָד</span> três dos valentes de Davi, <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.5\">1 Ch 12:5</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.21\">21</a>; <strong>c.</strong>  v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.21\">21</a> (𝔊 Ἰωζαβειθ, Ἰωζαβειδ).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹזָבָד</span> um chefe benjamita <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.18\">2 Ch 17:18</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  sacerdotes e levitas, <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹזָבָד</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.4\">1 Ch 26:4</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹזָבָד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.13\">2 Ch 31:13</a> (𝔊 Ἐζαβαθ, Ἰωαζαβαθ; 𝔊L Ἰωαζαβαδ); <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 35:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.35.9\">35:9</a> (𝔊 Ἰωζαβαδ; 𝔊L como o precedente); <strong>d.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" href=\"/Ezra.8.33\">Ezr 8:33</a>; <strong>e.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:22\" href=\"/Ezra.10.22\">Ezr 10:22</a>; <strong>f.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:23\" href=\"/Ezra.10.23\">Ezr 10:23</a>; <strong>g.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.7\">Ne 8:7</a>; <strong>h.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:16\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.16\">Ne 11:16</a>; (<strong>d. f. g.</strong> e <strong>h.</strong> talvez o mesmo homem).",
