      "preview": "יְהוֹיָדָע: nome próprio masculino: Jeoiada, Joiada.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹיָדָע</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹיָדָע</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>conhece;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, יְדַעְיָה\" href=\"/BDB,_יְדַעְיָה\", dir=\"rtl\">יְדַעְיָה</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֶלְיָדָע\" href=\"/BDB,_אֶלְיָדָע\", dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְיָדָע</a> e referências, <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעֶלְיָדָע</span><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span>; 𝔊 geralmente Ἰωδαε, A às vezes Ἰωιαδαε (<a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.30\">2 S 23:30</a> +), 𝔊L Ἰωαδ (<a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.23\">2 S 20:23</a> Ἰωαδδαι), pai de Benaia (tempo de Davi), na combinação <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנָיָהוּ בֶּן־יְהוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.18\">2 S 8:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:23\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.23\">20:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.20\">23:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.22\">22</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.8\">1 K 1:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:26\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:32\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.32\">32</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:36\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.36\">36</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:38\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.38\">38</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:44\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.44\">44</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.25\">2:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.29\">29</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:34\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.34\">34</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:35\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:46\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.46\">46</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.4\">4:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1\">1 Ch 1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.24\">24</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.17\">18:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.5\">27:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹיָדָע בֶּן־בְּנָיָהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.34\">1 Ch 27:34</a> é provavelmente inversão errônea da ordem usual; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> isoladamente somente <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.28\">1 Ch 12:28</a> (onde é chamado <span dir=\"rtl\">הַנָּגִיד לְאַחֲרֹן</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span>, 𝔊 geralmente Ἰωδαε A às vezes Ἰωιαδαε etc., sacerdote (principal) em Jerusalém no tempo de Joás <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.4\">2 K 11:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:9\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.9\">9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:15\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.3\">12:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 12:10\" href=\"/II_Kings.12.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 22:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.22.11\">2 Ch 22:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.1\">23:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.8\">8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:11\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.2\">24:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.14\">14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:22\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:25\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.25\">25</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.26\">Je 29:26</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹיָדָע</span> um construtor no muro de Jerusalém, com Neemias, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.6\">Ne 3:6</a> (𝔊 Ἰοειαα, Ἰοειδα, Ἰωδαε, etc.)<br><strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> filho do sumo sacerdote Eliasibe <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.10\">Ne 12:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:28\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.28\">13:28</a> (𝔊 Ἰωδα, Ἰωδαε, Ἰωιαδα).",
