      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹנָתָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹנָתָן</span></big>  <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹנָתָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹנָתָן</span></big> <strong>nome próprio masculino.</strong> 𝔊 Ἰωναθαν em toda parte, com variantes ocasionais <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>deu;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֶלְנָתָן\" href=\"/BDB,_אֶלְנָתָן\", dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְנָתָן</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, נְתַנְיָ֫הוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_נְתַנְיָ֫הוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">נְתַנְיָהוּ</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, נְתַנְאֵל\" href=\"/BDB,_נְתַנְאֵל\", dir=\"rtl\">נְתַנְאֵל</a>, e referências, temanita <span dir=\"rtl\">רמננתן</span> Hal<sup>RÉJ 1884, ix. 7 f.</sup> Nbr<sup>Stud. Bib. i. 211</sup>; sabeu <span dir=\"rtl\">והבאום</span> Hal <sup>10</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> filho de Saul <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.6\">1 S 14:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.1\">18:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 40 vezes 1Sm; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 1:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.1.4\">2 S 1:4</a> + 18 vezes 2Sm; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.33\">1 Ch 8:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.34\">34</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:39\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.39\">9:39</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:40\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.40\">40</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.2\">1 S 13:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.3\">3</a> + 27 vezes 1Sm, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.2\">1 Ch 10:2</a>.<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> filho de Abiatar <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.27\">2 S 15:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.17\">17:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.20\">20</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:42\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.42\">1 K 1:42</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:43\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.43\">43</a>.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> sobrinho de Davi <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.21\">2 S 21:21</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:7\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.7\">1 Ch 20:7</a>; aparentemente chamado Jonadabe <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.3\">2 S 13:3 ff.</a> onde 𝔊L Ἰωναθαν, cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, יְהוֹנָדָב\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_יְהוֹנָדָב\">יהונדב</a> <strong>2.</strong><br>†<strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹד</span> de Davi, isto é, seu tio? <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.32\">1 Ch 27:32</a>.<br>†<strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> um dos heróis de Davi <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.32\">2 S 23:32</a> (cf. Dr) = <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹנָתָן</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.34\">1 Ch 11:34</a>.<br>†<strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> um dos tesoureiros de Davi <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.25\">1 Ch 27:25</a>.<br>†<strong>7.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> um escriba <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.15\">Je 37:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 37:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.37.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 38:26\" href=\"/Jeremiah.38.26\">38:26</a>.<br>†<strong>8.</strong>  levitas <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 17:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.17.8\">2 Ch 17:8</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:35\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.35\">Ne 12:35</a>.<br>†<strong>9.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> um sacerdote <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.18\">Ne 12:18</a>.<br>†<strong>10.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹ׳</span> sacerdote da tribo de Dã, filho de Gérson <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:30\" href=\"/Judges.18.30\">Ju 18:30</a>.<br>†<strong>11.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> um capitão judaíta, após a queda de Jerusalém <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.8\">Je 40:8</a>.<br>†<strong>12.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> um judaíta <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.32\">1 Ch 2:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.33\">33</a>.<br>†<strong>13.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> pai de Ebede <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:6\" href=\"/Ezra.8.6\">Ezr 8:6</a>.<br>†<strong>14.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> filho de Asael <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:15\" href=\"/Ezra.10.15\">Ezr 10:15</a>.<br>†<strong>15.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> um sacerdote <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.14\">Ne 12:14</a>.<br>†<strong>16.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹ׳</span> filho de Joiada <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.11\">Ne 12:11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> aparentemente = <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹחָנָן</span> <strong>2.</strong>",
