      "preview": "יְהוֹשׁוּעַ: nome próprio masculino e de lugar: Josué, Jesua.",
      "html": "<big><span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשׁוּעַ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</span></big>  e (mais tarde <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span>, <strong>nome próprio masculino.</strong> (e <strong>de lugar</strong>, v. <strong>9</strong> abaixo.) <strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>é salvação</em>, ou <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>é opulência</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִישָׁע\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִישָׁע\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִישָׁע</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִישׁוּעַ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִישׁוּעַ\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִישׁוּעַ</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲבִישׁוּעַ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲבִישׁוּעַ\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִישׁוּעַ</a>, e Nes<sup>SK 1892, 573 f.</sup>; em todo caso veio a ser associado a <span dir=\"rtl\">ישׁע</span>, cf. Mt 1.21; sobre <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> v. especialmente Frä<sup>VOJ iv, 1890, 332 f.</sup> Müll<sup>SK 1892, 177 f.</sup> que citam analogias para a mudança de <span dir=\"rtl\">וֹ</span> em —ֵ posterior, e Nes<sup>l.c.</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  sucessor de Moisés, filho de Num, (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς) <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשׁוּעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.21\">Dt 3:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:7\" href=\"/Judges.2.7\">Ju 2:7</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:9\" href=\"/Exodus.17.9\">Ex 17:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:10\" href=\"/Exodus.17.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:13\" href=\"/Exodus.17.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 17:14\" href=\"/Exodus.17.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:13\" href=\"/Exodus.24.13\">24:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:17\" href=\"/Exodus.32.17\">32:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:11\" href=\"/Exodus.33.11\">33:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:28\" href=\"/Numbers.11.28\">Nu 11:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:16\" href=\"/Numbers.13.16\">13:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:6\" href=\"/Numbers.14.6\">14:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:30\" href=\"/Numbers.14.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:38\" href=\"/Numbers.14.38\">38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:65\" href=\"/Numbers.26.65\">26:65</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:18\" href=\"/Numbers.27.18\">27:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 27:22\" href=\"/Numbers.27.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:12\" href=\"/Numbers.32.12\">32:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:28\" href=\"/Numbers.32.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:17\" href=\"/Numbers.34.17\">34:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:38\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.38\">Dt 1:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.28\">3:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.3\">31:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.14\">14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.9\">34:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 1:1\" href=\"/Joshua.1.1\">Jos 1:1</a> + 167 vezes Js; <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:1\" href=\"/Judges.1.1\">Ju 1:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:6\" href=\"/Judges.2.6\">2:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:7\" href=\"/Judges.2.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:8\" href=\"/Judges.2.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:21\" href=\"/Judges.2.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 2:23\" href=\"/Judges.2.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:34\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.34\">1 K 16:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:27\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.27\">1 Ch 7:27</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.17\">Ne 8:17</a> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς); segundo P, nome mudado por Moisés do original <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹשֵׁעַ</span> v. este <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:8\" href=\"/Numbers.13.8\">Nu 13:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:16\" href=\"/Numbers.13.16\">16</a> (𝔊 Αὑση) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:44\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.44\">Dt 32:44</a> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς).<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</span> um bet-semita <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.14\">1 S 6:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.18\">18</a> (𝔊 Ὡσηε, A Ἰησοῦς, 𝔊L Ἰωσηε).<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  sumo sacerdote após a restauração, filho de Jeozadaque <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</span> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς) <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:1\" href=\"/Haggai.1.1\">Hg 1:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:12\" href=\"/Haggai.1.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:14\" href=\"/Haggai.1.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:2\" href=\"/Haggai.2.2\">2:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Haggai 2:4\" href=\"/Haggai.2.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.1\">Zc 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:3\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:6\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:8\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:11\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.11\">6:11</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:2\" href=\"/Ezra.2.2\">Ezr 2:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:2\" href=\"/Ezra.3.2\">3:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:8\" href=\"/Ezra.3.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:3\" href=\"/Ezra.4.3\">4:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:2\" href=\"/Ezra.5.2\">5:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:18\" href=\"/Ezra.10.18\">10:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.7\">Ne 7:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.1\">12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.26\">26</a>.<br>†<strong>4.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהוֹשֻׁעַ</span> governador de Jerusalém sob Josias <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.8\">2 K 23:8</a> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς, 𝔊L Ἰωσηε).<br>†<strong>5.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς) chefe de uma das classes sacerdotais <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.11\">1 Ch 24:11</a>, possivelmente também <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:36\" href=\"/Ezra.2.36\">Ezr 2:36</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:38\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.38\">Ne 7:39</a>.<br>†<strong>6.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 Ἰησοῦς, etc.), um nome de família levítica de ocorrência frequente: <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:40\" href=\"/Ezra.2.40\">Ezr 2:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:9\" href=\"/Ezra.3.9\">3:9</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.42\">Ne 7:43</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.7\">8:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.4\">9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.10\">10:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.8\">12:8</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.15\">2 Ch 31:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" href=\"/Ezra.8.33\">Ezr 8:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:24\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.24\">Ne 12:24</a>.<br>†<strong>7.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 <em>idem.</em>), pai de um construtor no muro <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:19\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.19\">Ne 3:19</a>, talvez =<br>†<strong>8.</strong>  um nome de família judaíta (𝔊 <em>idem.</em>), <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:6\" href=\"/Ezra.2.6\">Ezr 2:6</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.11\">Ne 7:11</a> (cf. Sm<sup>Listen 12</sup>).<br>†<strong>9.</strong>  <strong> nome próprio de lugar.</strong> no sul de Judá <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.26\">Ne 11:26</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּיֵשׁוּעַ</span> (𝔊 ἐν Ἰησού, 𝔊L ἐν Σουα).",
