      "preview": "מְהוּמָה: tumulto, confusão, inquietação, desbaratamento.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְהוּמָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino: tumulto, confusão, inquietação, desbaratamento</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.23\">Dt 7:23</a> + 7 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהוּמַת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.11\">1 S 5:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.5\">Ez 22:5</a>; plural absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהוּמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.5\">2 Ch 15:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהוּמֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:9\" href=\"/Amos.3.9\">Am 3:9</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>tumulto, confusão</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:9\" href=\"/Amos.3.9\">Am 3:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשׁוּקִים</span> <em>opressão</em>), <em>perturbação, agitação</em> (oposto a paz) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.5\">2 Ch 15:5</a> (‖ verbo <span dir=\"rtl\">המם</span> v. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.6\">6</a>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.5\">Ez 22:5</a>; <em>inquietação</em> (da mente) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.16\">Pr 15:16</a>; especialmente <em>tumulto e confusão, pânico</em>, devido a juízo divino <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהוּמַת־י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:13\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.13\">Zc 14:13</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.7\">Ez 7:7</a>; também <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.9\">1 S 5:9</a> e <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהוּמַת מָוֶת</span> v. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.11\">11</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>desbaratamento</em> (devido a <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>) na guerra <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.20\">1 S 14:20</a> (cf. v. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.22\">22</a>); <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.23\">Dt 7:23</a> (acusativo cognato com <span dir=\"rtl\">הום</span> v. este), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.20\">28:20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְאֵרָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִגְעֶרֶת</span>); cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, יוֹם\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_יוֹם\">יוֹם מ׳</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.5\">Is 22:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְבוּסָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְבוּכָה</span>) <em>um dia de desbaratamento, pisoteamento e confusão</em>.",
