      "preview": "הוֹן: riqueza, suficiência.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹן</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.18\">Pr 8:18</a></sup>, <strong>riqueza, suficiência</strong> (poético, quase inteiramente na literatura sapiencial, especialmente Pv; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_אוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">1. אוֹן</a> p. 20 acima.)—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.13\">Pr 1:13</a> + 15 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.12\">Ez 27:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.18\">18</a> (onde 𝔊 𝔖 Co <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹנֵךְ</span>); construto <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:31\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.31\">Pr 6:31</a> + 3 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֶֹנ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.9\">Pr 3:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹנֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.27\">Ez 27:27</a> + v. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.18\">18</a> Co; <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.8\">Pr 28:8</a>; plural com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹנַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:33\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.33\">Ez 27:33</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>riqueza</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:3\" href=\"/Psalms.112.3\">ψ 112:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עֹשֶׁר</span>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.18\">Pr 8:18</a> (‖ <em>idem.</em>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.13\">1:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁלָל</span>) cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, עָשִׁיר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_עָשִׁיר\">הוֹן עָשִׁיר</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.15\">Pr 10:15</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּלִּים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.11\">18:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.9\">Pr 3:9</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵאשִׁית כָּל־תְּבוּאָתֶ֑ךָ</span>) <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹן בֵּיתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:31\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.31\">Pr 6:31</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.7\">Ct 8:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּיִת וָהוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.14\">Pr 19:14</a>; veja-se <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 19:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.19.4\">19:4</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.8\">28:8</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּלִּים</span>); também <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:14\" href=\"/Psalms.119.14\">ψ 119:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.4\">Pr 11:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.27\">12:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.7\">13:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.11\">11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.4\">24:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 28:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.28.22\">28:22</a> (oposto a <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶסֶר</span>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 29:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.29.3\">29:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.12\">Ez 27:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:33\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.33\">33</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  com <span dir=\"rtl\">מָכַר</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> de preço, = <em>alto valor</em>, ou <em>preço</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּמְכֹּר עַמְּךָ בְּלֹא הוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:13\" href=\"/Psalms.44.13\">ψ 44:13</a>—isto é, por baixo preço, = ‘sem preço algum’ (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מחיר</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>suficiência, basta!</em> em exclamação <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.15\">Pr 30:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.16\">16</a> (assim também 𝔖 𝔗, Aq Sym Theod ἀρκεῖ).",
